 you: `Enter password for superuser@172.30.231.17:30:`\n> 2. It connects, creates `koby-bowser-ansible`, and installs your Ed25519 key.\n> 3. You will see <span style=\"color:green\">**`[OK] Verified! Passwordless SSH login successful as 'koby-bowser-ansible'`**</span>.\n> 4. Ansible executes [playbooks/copy-to-tmp.yml](file:///home/koby/.ansible/playbooks/copy-to-tmp.yml) and reports <span style=\"color:green\">**`[SUCCESS]`**</span>.\n>\n> From that moment on, the host has **permanent passwordless key access** for `koby-bowser-ansible`, so you won't need `-K` or passwords on subsequent runs!"}
